      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see. u mentioned nigeria is more relationship-driven and has infrastructure issues. are u saying that's mostly a matter of the local work ethic or just the govt/tech side of things? like, should i be worried about things like corruption or people not being as professional with deadlines compared to the vietnam side?",
