      "content": "it's just that i've heard some things about it being harder to get things done there because of how people operate on the ground. do you think there's a fundamental difference in how people in these regions approach business integrity? like, is it a more \"wild west\" style of doing business in nigeria compared to the more disciplined approach you see in SE asia?",
